The app bundles whisper.cpp/ggml, a default Whisper model, FFmpeg, Electron,
interface fonts and word-alignment code adapted from WhisperX and TorchAudio.
Optional Python software and model assets are installed or downloaded
separately by the user; their terms are separate from Transcriber's GPLv3
licence.

